name 'ai-and-algorithmic-decisions-postassessment-q8_2025'

question 'A food delivery app has a "Recalculate Total" button that adds up your order cost again each time you change an item. What most likely happens when you press that button?'

wrong 'The app randomly changes your total to test whether you\'re paying attention.'
wrong 'The app loads an entirely new webpage for every single update.'
right 'The app calls a function that adds the prices of all items and updates the total on screen.'
wrong 'The app changes the color of the total text without changing the number.'

allow_multiple_attempts true

